        {
            "name": "Maha Shivratri",
            "date": "2021-03-11",
            "type": "FH",
            "categories": "B",
            "note": "Since two Closed/Public Holidays namely SAIL Foundation Day (24th January, 2021) and Independence Day (15th August, 2021) fall on Sunday, Restricted Holidays namely Maha Shivratri (11th March, 2021) and Janmashtami (30th August, 2021) will be treated as additional festival holidays for maintaining the total number of Public/Closed/Festival holidays to 18 for non-industrial non-executive employees attached to offices, including Education Department and Kolkata Branch Office."
        },
