            "note": "Two Festival Holidays namely Netaji's Birth Day and Christmas Day fall on the 4th Saturday. Hence, two other Restricted Holidays namely Buddha Purnima (26th May, 2021) and Mahalaya (6th October, 2021) will be treated as additional festival holidays for maintaining the total number of Public/Closed/Festival holidays to 18 for non-executive employees who are entitled to get the 2nd and 4th Saturday in a month as an additional weekly off-day."
